{"availability":"available","full":"opengeospatial/aim-swg","name":"aim-swg","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":2,"forks":1,"created":"2023-06-01T16:39:06Z","updated":"2026-10-07T14:18:09Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://json-ld.org/playground/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.616Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.616Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.616Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.616Z","stars":2,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository contains the modules comprising all the layers of the Agriculture Information Model (AIM).","The Agriculture Information Model (AIM) is a common vocabulary providing the basis for semantic interoperability across smart farming solutions. AIM defines the data elements, including concepts, properties and relationships relevant to agri applications, as well as their associated semantics/meaning for information exchange. Built upon a thorough analysis of the related state of the art and practice, and driven by the elicited stakeholder requirements in H2020 DEMETER project, AIM aims to establish the basis of a common agricultural data space and enable the interoperability of different…","AIM has been designed following a layered and modular approach, and is realised as a suite of ontologies implemented in line with best practices, reusing existing standards and well-scoped dominant models as much as possible and establishing alignments between them to enable their interoperability and the integration of existing data. AIM is scalable and can be easily extended in order to address additional needs and incorporate new concepts, maintaining its consistency and compliance. In particular, AIM comprises the following layers:"],"features":["the meta-model layer defining the building blocks of AIM and enabling the back-and-forth conversion between datasets that are based on the property graph model and linked data datasets","the cross-domain layer defining relevant concepts and properties that are common across multiple domains, and which enable the interoperability with existing standard models and vocabularies","the domain layer defining agri-specific concepts and properties covering different aspects of interest of agri applications, and which enables the integration of relevant vocabularies in the sector.","The pilot-specific layer defining additional concepts and properties that are of specific use for particular applications.","Re-alignment to FIWARE, now SmartDataModels, using latest models and the now official URIs"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opengeospatial/aim-swg/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ce9a792322b59b43e6a523aa3653a48d0302f69fc6b5ccb578921aed83580751","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.800Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.800Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This repository contains the modules comprising all the layers of the Agriculture Information Model (AIM).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opengeospatial/aim-swg/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ce9a792322b59b43e6a523aa3653a48d0302f69fc6b5ccb578921aed83580751","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opengeospatial/aim-swg/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.801Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T14:18:09Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opengeospatial/aim-swg/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:35:48.803Z","hash":"ce9a792322b59b43e6a523aa3653a48d0302f69fc6b5ccb578921aed83580751","originalBytes":28289,"storedBytes":28289,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["aim","json-ld","e.g.","data","concept","terms","using","farm","land","property","reference","shacl","valid","validation","ontology","prefix","xsd","datetime","used","context","crop","cross-domain","datatype","examples","layer